{"id":"73717706953334f5","group":"67","path":"67/67-df-degree-complexity.md","title":"Sentence Complexity Classes of Interpretability Degrees","display":"df-degree-complexity — Sentence Complexity Classes of Interpretability Degrees","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-df-degree-complexity","aliases":["67-df-degree-complexity"],"display":"df-degree-complexity — Sentence Complexity Classes of Interpretability Degrees","depends_on":["[[67-df-degree-structure]]","[[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li\\[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 10] P (2855)\\[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 1 - libgen.li.pdf","source_chapter":"7","source_section":"§2","source_label":"definition of a Phi degree in §2","source_printed_pages":[102],"source_pdf_pages":[113],"verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_status":"not-applicable-definition","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-df-degree-complexity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-df-degree-complexity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-degree-complexity — Sentence Complexity Classes of Interpretability Degrees"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f5b9611e728efd8b\" href=\"?note=f5b9611e728efd8b\" title=\"67-df-degree-structure\">67-df-degree-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"851cd80e64893935\" href=\"?note=851cd80e64893935\" title=\"67-df-arithmetical-classes\">67-df-arithmetical-classes</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 10] P (2855)[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 1 - libgen.li.pdf"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"7"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§2"},{"key":"source_label","html":"definition of a Phi degree in §2"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>102</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>113</span></div>"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-applicable-definition"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,D_T,d_T\">\\(T,D_T,d_T\\)</span> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f5b9611e728efd8b\" href=\"?note=f5b9611e728efd8b\" title=\"67-df-degree-structure\">67-df-degree-structure</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\">\\(\\Phi\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_A\">\\(L_A\\)</span> 公式的任意给定集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span> 为句子集。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_n,\\Pi_n,B_1,\\Delta_2^{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(\\Sigma_n,\\Pi_n,B_1,\\Delta_2^{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"851cd80e64893935\" href=\"?note=851cd80e64893935\" title=\"67-df-arithmetical-classes\">67-df-arithmetical-classes</a> 的原书算术公式类；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T+\\varphi=T\\cup\\{\\varphi\\}\">\\(T+\\varphi=T\\cup\\{\\varphi\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf D_T(\\Phi)\">\\(\\mathsf D_T(\\Phi)\\)</span> 是以公式类为参数的度集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf S_T,\\mathsf P_T,\\mathsf B_T\">\\(\\mathsf S_T,\\mathsf P_T,\\mathsf B_T\\)</span> 为本原子引入的集合缩写。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf D_T(\\Phi)\\coloneqq\\{d_T(T+\\varphi):\\varphi\\in\\Phi\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf D_T(\\Phi)\\coloneqq\\{d_T(T+\\varphi):\\varphi\\in\\Phi\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf S_T\\coloneqq\\mathsf D_T(\\Sigma_1),\\qquad\\mathsf P_T\\coloneqq\\mathsf D_T(\\Pi_1),\\qquad\\mathsf B_T\\coloneqq\\mathsf D_T(B_1).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf S_T\\coloneqq\\mathsf D_T(\\Sigma_1),\\qquad\\mathsf P_T\\coloneqq\\mathsf D_T(\\Pi_1),\\qquad\\mathsf B_T\\coloneqq\\mathsf D_T(B_1).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应原书第7章§2（印刷102页，PDF113页）“度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\">\\(\\Phi\\)</span>，若存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\">\\(\\Phi\\)</span> 句 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a=d(T+\\varphi)\">\\(a=d(T+\\varphi)\\)</span>”。这是一种存在代表句的性质，不能把理论所有公理都属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\">\\(\\Phi\\)</span>、公理集编码的算术复杂度、某个任选代表的复杂度与其混同。</p>\n<p>同一度可以同时在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf S_T\">\\(\\mathsf S_T\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf P_T\">\\(\\mathsf P_T\\)</span> 中，其见证句不必相同。算术类采用本书第1章的 PR 公式基底及 PA 可证明等价约定，不替换为未经比较的跨书同名类。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-degree-structure","status":"resolved","id":"f5b9611e728efd8b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-degree-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-arithmetical-classes","status":"resolved","id":"851cd80e64893935","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-degree-structure","status":"resolved","id":"f5b9611e728efd8b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T,D_T,d_T$ 按 [[67-df-degree-structure]]；$\\Phi$ 是 $L_A$ 公式的任意给定集合，$\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}$ 为句子集。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-arithmetical-classes","status":"resolved","id":"851cd80e64893935","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma_n,\\Pi_n,B_1,\\Delta_2^{\\mathrm{PA}}$ 是 [[67-df-arithmetical-classes]] 的原书算术公式类；$T+\\varphi=T\\cup\\{\\varphi\\}$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"T,D_T,d_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi","display":false},{"tex":"L_A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_n,\\Pi_n,B_1,\\Delta_2^{\\mathrm{PA}}","display":false},{"tex":"T+\\varphi=T\\cup\\{\\varphi\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf D_T(\\Phi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf S_T,\\mathsf P_T,\\mathsf B_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf D_T(\\Phi)\\coloneqq\\{d_T(T+\\varphi):\\varphi\\in\\Phi\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf S_T\\coloneqq\\mathsf D_T(\\Sigma_1),\\qquad\\mathsf P_T\\coloneqq\\mathsf D_T(\\Pi_1),\\qquad\\mathsf B_T\\coloneqq\\mathsf D_T(B_1).","display":true},{"tex":"a","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"a=d(T+\\varphi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf S_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf P_T","display":false}],"bytes":2030,"backlinks":[{"id":"ed21199fbef98411","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$D_T,\\mathsf S_T,\\mathsf P_T$ 采用 [[67-df-degree-complexity]]；$\\mathrm{Sup}_T$ 采用 [[67-df-degree-bounds]]。"},{"id":"53ac2709b362624c","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf S_T,\\mathsf P_T$ 按 [[67-df-degree-complexity]]；$\\mathrm{Low}_T$ 按 [[67-df-degree-high-low]]；$\\mathrm{Cofinal}_T$ 按 [[67-df-degree-cofinality]]。"},{"id":"64054515b205b16a","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T,D_T,\\mathbf0_T,\\mathbf1_T,\\mathsf S_T,\\mathsf P_T,\\mathsf B_T$ 采用 [[67-df-degree-complexity]] 及 [[67-df-degree-structure]] 的定义与前提。"},{"id":"b28efaa3c7df6cd2","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T,D_T,\\mathsf D_T$ 按 [[67-df-degree-complexity]] 及其固定一致 r.e. 基础理论 $T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}$。"},{"id":"ecb1675a32137cec","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf P_T$ 采用 [[67-df-degree-complexity]]；$\\mathrm{RPDeg}_T$ 采用 [[67-df-degree-reduction-principle]]。"},{"id":"afbe0f23c45d10d5","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T,D_T,<_T,\\mathbf0_T$ 按 [[67-df-degree-structure]]；$\\mathsf S_T,\\mathsf P_T$ 按 [[67-df-degree-complexity]]。"},{"id":"e5f6b697b0ac9e9c","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T,D_T,d_T,\\mathsf P_T,\\mathrm{PC}_T,\\operatorname{pc}_T$ 采用 [[67-df-degree-pseudocomplement]] 与 [[67-df-degree-complexity]] 的定义及固定一致基础理论 $T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}$。"},{"id":"7f3094a41722b9e6","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T,D_T,\\mathsf S_T$ 按 [[67-df-degree-complexity]]；$\\mathrm{PC}_T$ 及部分函数 $\\operatorname{pc}_T$ 按 [[67-df-degree-pseudocomplement]]。"},{"id":"38502195e450dd58","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-degree-complexity]]"},{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-16","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-degree-complexity]]"},{"id":"161ada0e6be38670","anchor":"ref-53","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-thm-interpretability-l